  "subject": "A stilt walker working the Tsim Sha Tsui promenade at three metres tall can see every rooftop water tank in Kowloon but cannot bend down, so when a tourist toddler's coin bounces out of his hat onto the paving it takes a small girl climbing onto a bench to hand it back.",
